---
import { taxEstimateNote } from '../data/campaign';
---
<section class="tax-increase container" aria-labelledby="tax-increase-title">
  <div class="tax-increase-panel">
    <h2 id="tax-increase-title"><span class="tax-amount">More than $1,700<sup><a href="#tax-estimate-note" aria-label="Read the tax estimate footnote">*</a></sup></span><span class="tax-headline-detail">in new taxes since 2020<br class="tax-desktop-break" /> for many households.</span></h2>
    <div class="tax-increase-copy">
      <p>Pasadena voters have already approved multiple tax and bond measures for the city and school district since 2020.</p>
      <p>City and school measures since 2020 already add <strong>more than $1,700 in new taxes for many households.</strong><sup class="tax-note-marker"><a href="#tax-estimate-note" aria-label="Read the tax estimate footnote">*</a></sup></p>
      <p>Measure PFD would add approximately $304 a year for a 1,600-square-foot home.</p>
      <p class="tax-rally">Pasadena families have done their part. Enough is enough.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="tax-estimate-note" id="tax-estimate-note"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span><span>Campaign estimate. {taxEstimateNote} Excludes the proposed $304 annual PFD charge.</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tax-increase { padding-bottom: 36px; }
  .tax-increase-panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.3fr; align-items: center; gap: 24px 52px; padding: 36px 40px 20px; background: #fff7f7; border-left: 4px solid var(--red); }
  .tax-increase h2 { display: grid; gap: 6px; line-height: 1.1; }
  .tax-amount { display: block; color: var(--red); font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 42px); }
  .tax-headline-detail { display: block; font-size: clamp(22px, 2vw, 28px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
  .tax-increase sup { font-size: .5em; vertical-align: super; line-height: 0; }
  .tax-increase sup a { text-decoration: none; padding-inline: 2px; }
  .tax-increase .tax-note-marker { font-size: .75em; color: inherit; }
  .tax-estimate-note { display: flex; gap: 6px; grid-column: 1 / -1; margin: 0; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #e8dada; color: var(--green-soft); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; scroll-margin-top: 170px; }
  .tax-estimate-note > span:first-child { color: var(--green); }
  .tax-increase-copy > p { font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--green-soft); }
  .tax-increase-copy strong { color: var(--green); font-weight: 650; }
  .tax-increase-copy .tax-rally { color: var(--green); font-weight: 650; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .tax-increase { padding-bottom: 28px; }
    .tax-increase-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 22px; padding: 28px 28px 20px; }
    .tax-increase h2 { max-width: 500px; }
    .tax-desktop-break { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .tax-increase-panel { padding: 25px 22px 18px; }
  }
</style>
